  "body": "Title and CCC issued. Move in today!\r\nDiscover exceptional value in this architecturally designed, three-level terrace home offering approximately 156.8m² (more or less) of stylish, low-maintenance living. Featuring four bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, including two master suites, open-plan living, a designer kitchen with premium appliances, a sunny balcony, a private entertaining deck, an internal-access garage and additional parking, this home is designed for modern family living.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of walking to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Pak'nSave, Woolworths, cafés, restaurants, public transport and everyday amenities, with parks, sports facilities and community spaces nearby.\r\n\r\nZoned for sought-after schools:\r\n\r\nMacleans Primary School\r\nHowick Intermediate\r\nPakuranga College\r\nBuilt by a reputable developer and backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, this brand-new home offers contemporary comfort, practical design and peace of mind. With no Body Corporate or Society fees, you can enjoy greater ownership simplicity and long-term value.\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-home buyers, growing families and investors seeking a quality property in a desirable location, this is an opportunity to secure modern living in Bucklands Beach.\r\n\r\nBrand-new living. Excellent school zones. No Body Corporate fees. Real value.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing before this opportunity is Gone.",
